157: - [x] 3.4 Update `PublicPlayerStateModel` to match backend `PlayerState.java`. Add missing fields:
158:   ```typescript
159:   export interface PublicPlayerStateModel {
160:     playerId: string;
161:     side: string;            // PlayerSide enum as string
162:     activePokemon: PublicPokemonSlotModel | null;
163:     bench: PublicPokemonSlotModel[];
164:     deckCount: number;       // count only, not full array
165:     discardCount: number;    // count only, not full array
166:     prizesCount: number;     // count only, opponent's prizes hidden
